---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Features — Wevenue">
  <section class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold text-center mb-6 bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-linear-to-r from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500">
        Built Different
      </h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-20 text-lg">What makes Wevenue agents worth your time. 💜</p>

      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Feature cards -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-gray-700 rounded-2xl p-8 agent-card">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">⚡</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Instant Generation</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full multi-page sites in under a minute. Responsive, accessible, and SEO-ready out of the box.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 agent-card">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🧠</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-indigo-400">Multi-Agent Coordination</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Specialized agents for design, code, and quality review — no single model doing everything poorly.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 agent-card">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🔄</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-purple-400">Continuous Iteration</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your site evolves with you. Ask for tweaks, new sections, or a complete redesign — all conversationally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-pink-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 agent-card">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🌐</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-pink-400">One-Click Deploy</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Push to GitHub Pages, Vercel, or any host. Custom domains supported from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-yellow-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 agent-card">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🔒</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-yellow-400">Clean Code Output</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">No black boxes. You get readable, well-structured HTML/CSS/JS you can take anywhere.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 agent-card">
          <div class="text-4xl mb-4">💬</div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-2 text-cyan-400">Natural Language First</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">No templates to pick from, no knobs to turn. Just describe what you want and watch it appear.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Agent team -->
      <div class="mt-24">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-center mb-16">Meet Your Agent Team</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-indigo-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center agent-card">
            <div class="text-6xl mb-4">🎨</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-indigo-400 mb-1">Pixel</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-indigo-400/60 mb-4">Designer Agent</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">"I will make everything the right shade of purple. Do not test me."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-purple-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center agent-card">
            <div class="text-6xl mb-4">💻</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-purple-400 mb-1">Semicolon</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-purple-400/60 mb-4">Developer Agent</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">"Clean code isn't optional. It's a moral imperative."</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-gray-800/50 border border-pink-500/30 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center agent-card">
            <div class="text-6xl mb-4">🐛</div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-pink-400 mb-1">Bugger</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-pink-400/60 mb-4">QA Agent</p>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">"I found 3 bugs in the code I just wrote. It's not personal. ...It is personal."</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-20">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition text-lg">Start Building Free</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
